{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Sidebar 是一款講求「開啟、輸入、完成」的極速筆記 App，一開啟鍵盤便已就緒，讓你在數秒內記下閃過的念頭，然後立刻回到手上的工作。無需資料夾、無需檔名、無需格式設定，唯一要做的就是趁想法消失前寫下來。它適合思緒頻繁、需要隨手捕捉靈感的上班族與創作人，原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-92.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>每則筆記自動加上時間戳</h2>\n<p>每則筆記都是附有時間戳的記錄，而不是一份文件。加上 Todo 標籤會把事項加入任務清單，Win 或 Loss 會計入計分板，Love 則標記值得回頭細看的想法。計分板可追蹤跑步、螢幕使用時間等項目的得失，一眼看清哪些進度理想。此外可自選主題顏色、以 Widget 把想法釘在主畫面、在 iPhone、iPad 與 Mac 之間同步，並支援隱藏敏感筆記的模式與隨機回顧某一日的功能。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-54.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-55.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-56.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-57.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-58.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Sidebar | Fast Notes</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/sidebar-fast-notes/id6450434079?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:01:24.386556+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":413,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:54:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:19.465443+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:58:58.715397+00:00","content_hash":"e04c54b3705ff6a1d07ef7a6fae6b86aa72624f10bb1a92255d94ee29928bcfc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:01:24.386556+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}